// One block that adds 300 parameters: the graph of its sum has about 10^5
// neurons, each depending on thousands of input lanes. Searching for its form
// built, for every neuron, the set of lanes it reads, and took 12 GB and
// 40 s; the search now refuses a block whose sets pass a limit
// (src/lift/recognize.cpp, BlockModel), and the block runs by reference.
// tests/backend/cli.cmake runs it with tier statistics.
